WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:13.990
<b>Four Years Later</b>

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:18.240
<b>Seventh Year of the Kan'ei Era, 1630 AD 
Edo Castle</b>

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:21.290
But why go hunting monkeys?

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.190
At Sengen Shrine, in Suruga,

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.250
<b>Tokugawa Hidetada 
Second and Former Shogun</b>

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.250
monkeys are considered messengers of god.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.250
Don't you know that?

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:37.260
And to kill so many, in a shrine 
where slaying is forbidden...

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:42.030
I am so terribly sorry!

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:43.650
Tell me why.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.980
The forest...

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:53.030
The forest? What about the forest?

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:55.920
No...

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.950
I beg... I beg your forgiveness!

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:04.340
Be prepared to be stripped 
of your lands and peerage!

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:39.140
<i>In winter of that year, 
the second shogun, Hidetada,</i>

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:45.010
<b>Shiba, Path to Zoujoji</b>

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:41.170
<i>passed away from illness.</i>

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:45.010
<i>In accordance with his last order, 
the funeral was held in secret.</i>

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:49.520
<b>Ueno, Takasaki Castle</b>

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:52.440
<i>The year after Hidetada's death,</i>

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:56.400
<i>Tadanaga was to be found in 
the distant land of Joushuu.</i>

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:00.510
<i>It is said that only then 
was his monkey hunt</i>

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:03.280
<i>in Sengen Shrine punished.</i>

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.210
<b>Several Years Later</b>

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:21.300
<b><i>Evil Clouds Begin to Stir</i></b>

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.450
<i>Where is she?</i>

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.490
<i>Not making a move? Waiting for me?</i>

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:20.680
Hachisu!

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:33.930
I win.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:43.200
You never change... Stop being so nice.

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:50.720
You didn't hold back as much 
when we were kids.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:53.350
It was all I could do to keep up then.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:56.100
And now, it isn't?

00:04:57.140 --> 00:05:00.920
No... But is it the same for you, Hachisu?

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:04.740
If you'd kept firing...

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:07.210
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:09.520
I wasn't doing it for your sake.

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:13.750
This Lotus Root gun isn't quite done yet.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.250
I have to tell Gorone.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:20.940
You had him make a gun that fires so many 
times, and you still ask for more?

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:24.820
Poor guy...

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:31.710
Almost done.

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.090
Hang in there...

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:35.740
If you attack me, I'll stab you.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.960
This is nothing...

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.040
If I can't take it, I should just quit.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.350
Y-Your erotic allure is nothing to me.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:47.270
I bet... you can't stand this, either.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:51.370
The scent of a man...

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.070
I'm just fine...

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.130
Just fine.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.660
I told you...

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:03.300
I am not interested... in men.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.710
You aren't fooling anyone.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:11.050
Your words belie... the heat of your skin.

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:18.590
It's... just hot...

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.350
But...

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:25.860
Is there a point to this training?

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:31.260
The more... we restrain our emotions,

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.450
the more our abilities will increase.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:36.320
That's what Gorone said. Let's believe him.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:38.020
Is it true?

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:42.080
Lately, he's been pretty useless...

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.080
Want to try?

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.970
S-Stop it!

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:55.850
I said to stop!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.150
I can't take it...

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:03.510
Come.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:05.110
I'll stab you!

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:12.740
See? You like breasts, don't you?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.820
See?

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:17.620
Silence.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:21.620
I won't let you... deceive me!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.730
Saizou...

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.640
He was watching again!

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:39.140
Size isn't all that matters.

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.320
Wh-What?

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:44.030
Not everyone is the same!

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:46.240
You need something called "elegance."

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.170
Like you've ever seen a pair!

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:09.380
Welcome back.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:15.100
It's not like hearing

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:19.000
you two pant turns me on.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.690
It's just a way to kill some time.

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:14.320
Rui... You're all sweaty.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.950
I'm exhausted...

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:19.540
You were with Shichigen again?

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.960
Okay, guess I'll take mine off, too.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.380
This picture's wonderful...

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:36.700
It makes me feel like I can use many 
more types of hallucinations,

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.040
since you gave it to me.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:42.310
It makes me happy that you like it.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:47.230
Hey, it looks like you.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:54.900
It does not!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.540
You're so pretty!

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:59.240
Just like that picture!

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:01.110
Stop it.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:05.710
I'm going to show the enemy

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:10.450
an illusion, stained blood-red, 
just like that sky.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:15.990
But the illusion I really want to project

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:18.440
is something else.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:19.810
What is it?

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.470
I don't know.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:25.680
If you find it someday, show it to me!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.140
Sure.

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:41.060
The Lotus Root isn't fixed it yet...

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:44.240
It gets hard, and the trigger gets stiff.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.030
Only sometimes, right?

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:49.920
And if that "sometimes" was 
at an important time?

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.850
Well, you're right.

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:55.180
I'll fix it, eventually...

00:10:55.180 --> 00:11:00.110
"Eventually." That's
all you ever say, Gorone.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:04.000
You don't have to show me any respect.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:10.460
I bet you say that all I do is
lie around all day, right?

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.300
I do not.

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:17.150
Anyway, I think you need 
to work a little harder.

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:19.900
Who knows when they'll be back?

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:21.860
Right, right...

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.330
You needn't say another word.

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:25.110
I'll do it!

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:26.410
I'll do it, so...

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:32.920
"They," huh?

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:38.620
<i>How should one rid oneself of earthly desire?</i>

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:42.930
<i>Perhaps it is best done now,</i>

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.430
<i>right here.</i>

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:50.850
You the guy who ordered two dumplings?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.310
Oh, over here!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:54.810
You again?

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.950
Hibiki, can you come out front?

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:05.460
Sure, got it.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:11.480
Coming! Welcome!

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:18.280
You're really pretty, miss...

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:19.710
Got a boyfriend?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:21.640
Aw, I don't.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.020
You do, right?

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:23.840
Utsutsu...

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:26.850
Men are the worst.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:30.020
Rui, can you take over for Utsutsu?

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.200
Got it.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:36.610
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:37.710
The shogun is here!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:53.410
<i>I have finally made it to this point.</i>

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.910
How are our sales?

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:08.640
I'm doing the math now. Don't interrupt.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:11.830
Today, I sold lots of old clothes, too.

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.390
I think I made some good money!

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:18.040
I think you look better as 
a merchant, somehow.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.550
You and Hachisu, both.

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.530
Don't be silly!

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:24.780
But sometimes... I think...

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:28.490
that they won't be... coming back.

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:32.380
And if they don't, that would be fine, right?

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:35.240
We could just run our little store.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:36.790
It's fun!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.120
Maybe...

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.050
Don't say that. It's not that easy.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.050
How can you forget about the war?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:49.490
I haven't forgotten. It's just—

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:54.360
Why do you think Namenba spent years 
making this place the way it is?

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:56.490
Not because she wanted money.

00:13:56.490 --> 00:14:00.220
It was all to prepare for them.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.620
When Hachirou disappeared,

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:10.130
Saizou, Shikibu, and Shichigen all cried.

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:20.550
We were basically betrayed by him...

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.110
Protecting him was our goal.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.330
But I'm impressed by them.

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:30.590
They say he will return,

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.800
and they never doubted for a second.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:57.100
Believing that, they stayed here,

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.790
continuing to train their techniques.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:05.380
I don't know what some of 
them are doing, though.

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:14.390
If the Joujinshuu come...

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:18.900
If the Joujinshuu come, Hachirou will return.

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:28.150
Isn't that what they believe?

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:29.400
Yeah.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:32.780
So it's better that they come back?

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.620
It isn't good or bad.

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:38.170
But you have to think they will—

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.410
Even so...

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.640
Even if the Joujinshuu return,

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:45.170
there's no telling whether 
Hachirou will come back.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.520
<i>It seems so long ago...</i>

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:32.950
<i>But it's strange.</i>

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:35.740
<i>Ever since then, no matter where I am,</i>

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:38.180
<i>I can feel Hachirou.</i>

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:41.220
<i>And so,</i>

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:42.880
<i>I'm not lonely.</i>

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:26.150
<i>Your technique won't work on me.</i>

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.720
Your technique won't work on me.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.960
I see that you are Kouga Hachirou-sama.

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:34.460
You won't look me in the eye?

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.970
I'll pass, I'm afraid...

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:04.600
You only just learned how 
to fight with a blindfold.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:08.250
If I don't move, you can't rely on the sound.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:21.370
That is why I chose this place.

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:42.270
It isn't a good idea to make 
so much noise yourself.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:47.290
And you were the one who showed 
me it was possible to pass above.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.540
Let's hear why you're doing this.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:53.790
The battle is not yet over.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:18.140
My name is Hadaebou.

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:22.070
Your technique is stupid.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:23.970
I'm honored.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:46.560
It was rude of me to do so,

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:49.100
but I tested your skills.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.960
I have an urgent request.

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:59.820
The Dainagon of Suruga is 
now exiled to Kouzuke,

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:04.860
but he wishes to speak to you.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:05.960
What?

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:11.500
He says that something strange is coming.

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:13.620
Something strange?

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:18.070
Or perhaps, it has already come.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:34.010
A strange castle, you could say.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:38.630
It is called Murakumo.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.960
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:26.960
Hadaebou.

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:29.940
A shady priest who infests Edo Castle.

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:33.490
He travels the land as an agent of Tenkai.

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.980
Is he an ally or an enemy
of the Kouga and Iga?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:37.980
<b><i>Tadanaga's Change of Heart</i></b>
